{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1101108-how-would-you-make-wyrm-tainted-con-artists-a-threat","id":1101108,"title":"How would you make Wyrm Tainted con artists a threat?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-06T22:09:21-07:00","id":1101108,"title":"How would you make Wyrm Tainted con artists a threat?","content":"I have a question. I came up with an antagonist for a werewolf game when i eventually get it and i came up with this. The idea is a crime ring based in either Nigeria or South Africa running a banking scam. The scam basically goes like this, they open a bank somewhere in North America or Europe and make a promise a lot of people fall for, a promise of 1000 extra dollars placed in the first 100 accounts. Once these accounts get filled, the bank seems to keep it's promise and pays the account holders and closes openings for new accounts. But within a few months, the bank will suddenly close and the account holders will realize something horrible, their accounts have been completely emptied.<br /> <br /> The con men themselves are servants of the Wyrm and seem to be funneling their ill-gotten gains to cults like F.E.A.R and placing well placed investments in Pentex projects in Africa. My question is this, how would you make these guys a threat to Garou and the rest of the Fera?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T08:51:26-07:00","id":1101251,"title":"","content":"Well, I'd make them Formori with silver tongues and with bane as well as other Formori or BSD bodyguards.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T11:03:59-07:00","id":1101299,"title":"","content":"Are we talking about a physical threat or a spiritual one? Physical threats are easy, I like the above suggestion for a silver tongue. A whip-like silver tongue with sharpened edges would give them reach, a damaging weapon, and could potentially be a good surprise attack.<br /> <br /> If we are talking about a spiritual threat then I might recommend making them linked to Eater-of-Souls and the greed inherent in a pyramid scheme. A tempting sounding offer for a chance at riches draws in one person who then realizes they have been had and the only opportunity to save themselves is by preying on others. You can turn a good person to the service of the Wyrm who will then recruit others and on and on. The despair and greed feeds the Wyrm, and the new legions of devotees are a great bonus. It creates a long lasting and cyclical problem that the Garou can't just tear through to fix. Get them involved by having one of their Kinfolk drawn into the scheme.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3198-lunar-falcon","name":"Lunar Falcon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3198_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T12:06:47-07:00","id":1101321,"title":"","content":"Perhaps this group is headed by a Malfean Nephandus who has ties to/has infiltrated the Syndicate (or possibly Ngoma), who has this scam as a building block to induce a world-wide financial crisis. Granted that's not a Malfean Nephandus's usual MO but it could work out here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://paizo.com/campaigns/RageAcrossIreland/gameplay\" target=\"_blank\">My W20 Play-by-Post Game</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2760-formosus","name":"Formosus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T14:31:00-07:00","id":1101369,"title":"","content":"Good ideas Lunar. I can just picture a scene where a FBI agents get skewered by one of the guys in charge of the scam with the sharp tongue. I also really like the endless chain of scammers being effected by this one scam. I could see them tearing apart the crime ring, but odds are they will miss quite a few scam artists and formori that were created by them. The scam's leader is completely human but is protected by either a massive formori bodyguard or a BSD mercenary he hired to protect him. I am wondering if i should stick with the bank idea or do something like a investment scam.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T16:01:36-07:00","id":1101400,"title":"","content":"Maybe the gang's ringleader is a Wyrm-worshipping Ananasi Kinfolk and has a Kinfolk Gift or two enabling low-level mind control---but only if using 'things of the Weaver' as a medium?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T17:54:50-07:00","id":1101429,"title":"","content":"Anyone who falls victim to the scam becomes susceptible to possession by Banes that inspire/feed on feelings of anger, guilt, self-loathing, hopelessness, etc., leading to a rash of violent assaults, murders, suicides, family annihilations, and so forth. Including ones that impact one of the PC's Kinfolk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-07T20:50:29-07:00","id":1101485,"title":"","content":"I might consider the kinfolk idea. I also like the whole, scam victims turning into self-loathing violent indviduals. The pyramid scheme is either the banking firm or some type of company that sells a new type of energy drink from Asia called &quot; Boosters&quot;, which is actually water mixed with fruit juice and sugar. The leader is also a career conman who is on Interpol's wanted list and is currently under a alias.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}